  "slug": "employee-equipment-incident-report-form",
  "title": "Employee Equipment Incident Report Form",
  "subtitle": "Use this incident report to stabilize the event, preserve facts and evidence, analyze contributing factors, assign corrective work, and verify closeout for a employee equipment workflow.",
  "description": "An original operational employee equipment incident report form that controls a employee asset and access package from identity and routing through evidence, qualified decision, exception management, implementation, handoff, and final verification.",
  "use_case": "Use when the hiring manager, workplace coordinator, or asset custodian needs a traceable incident report so the authorized workplace, IT, security, or HR reviewer can issue, ship, substitute, repair, recover, or deny the requested equipment package under the approved role profile, asset standard, security baseline, purchasing policy, and accommodation route without relying on an informal email, spreadsheet, or unreviewed narrative.",
  "risk_tier": "B",
